    "type": "code_convention",
    "topic": "money-rounding",
    "title": "Round money only with round_money",
    "content": "Always round monetary Decimal results with ledgerly.money.round_money (half-up to the cent); never use Python's round() or a bare Decimal.quantize(), which use banker's rounding and produce wrong invoice totals.",
